 ("The blank character card glowing and lifting into the air while Mira and Bram stare in wonder.","bright gold glow",[("Hoot","Now let me show you around your sheet.")]),
 ("Mira and Bram joining Sela's round table, everyone welcoming them, Hoot on the screen top with wings wide.","warm golden tavern light",[("Sela","Welcome, heroes. Shall we begin?"),("Mira","We're ready!")]),
